{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1222"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c102): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c102.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1222"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge geography/countries","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/geography__countries.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",445],["+"," Bavaria is also the state with the most museums: the Institute for Museum Research in Berlin counted 1,254 of them in 2016, ahead of Baden-Württemberg with 1,140, from the Deutsches Museum in Munich to hundreds of small local heritage collections."],["=",395],["+","Even the names hold a record of sorts: 6 of the sixteen states carry a hyphen, a trace of how they were stitched together from older territories after 1945 – Baden-Württemberg, Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, Nordrhein-Westfalen, Rheinland-Pfalz, Sachsen-Anhalt and Schleswig-Holstein (in English: Baden-Württemberg, Mecklenburg-Western Pomerania, North Rhine-Westphalia, Rhineland-Palatinate, Saxony-Anhalt and Schleswig-Holstein).\n\n"],["=",119],["+","\n| Most museums | Bavaria | 1,254 (2016) |\n| Hyphenated names | six states | 6 |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",385],["+"," Bayern ist auch das Land mit den meisten Museen: Das Institut für Museumsforschung in Berlin zählte 2016 dort 1.254, vor Baden-Württemberg mit 1.140, vom Deutschen Museum in München bis zu Hunderten kleiner Heimatmuseen."],["=",345],["+","Selbst die Namen halten eine Art Rekord: 6 der sechzehn Länder tragen einen Bindestrich, eine Spur davon, wie sie nach 1945 aus älteren Gebieten zusammengefügt wurden – Baden-Württemberg, Mecklenburg-Vorpommern, Nordrhein-Westfalen, Rheinland-Pfalz, Sachsen-Anhalt und Schleswig-Holstein.\n\n"],["=",109],["+","\n| Meiste Museen | Bayern | 1.254 (2016) |\n| Namen mit Bindestrich | sechs Länder | 6 |"]]}]},
